{"seq":21,"slug":"frontend-architecture-patterns","title":"前端架构模式","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端架构模式-简介\">前端架构模式 简介</h1><p>前端架构在过去几年经历了从单一 SPA 到混合渲染、从整体式应用到联邦化组合的深刻变革。2026 年的前端开发已不再是&quot;选一个框架写所有页面&quot;的时代，而是针对不同场景选择最优渲染策略与组织模式的精细化工程。本知识库系统梳理当下主流的前端架构模式，帮助开发者在实际项目中做出合理的架构决策。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>渲染架构模式</strong>深入对比 CSR、SSR、SSG、ISR 四种渲染策略的适用场景与性能特征，详解 Islands Architecture 如何通过选择性水合大幅减少客户端 JavaScript，以及 React Server Components 如何重新定义前后端边界。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>应用结构设计</strong>聚焦代码组织方法论。Feature Sliced Design 提供了一套标准化的分层分片规范，Clean Architecture 思想在前端的落地实践解决了关注点分离问题，而模块化分层策略则为中大型项目提供了可扩展的目录结构方案。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>联邦与组合</strong>探讨运行时模块共享的前沿技术。Module Federation 2.0 已支持跨构建工具的运行时集成，微前端的运行时组合策略解决了多团队独立部署的协作难题，远程组件加载模式则让动态功能交付成为可能。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>架构演进策略</strong>关注从旧架构迁移到新架构的实战路径。渐进式迁移模式确保业务连续性，性能驱动的架构决策将 Core Web Vitals 指标转化为技术选型依据，技术选型决策框架则提供了系统化的评估方法论。</p>\n<p>适合有一定前端开发经验、正在主导或参与中大型项目架构设计的工程师阅读。建议先通读渲染架构章节建立全局视角，再根据项目实际需求深入其他章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-architecture","title":"渲染架构模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-strategies-comparison","title":"渲染策略对比与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/rendering-strategies-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"islands-architecture","title":"Islands Architecture 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/islands-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"react-server-components","title":"React Server Components 架构原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/react-server-components"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"application-structure","title":"应用结构设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-sliced-design","title":"Feature Sliced Design 方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/feature-sliced-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture-frontend","title":"Clean Architecture 前端实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/clean-architecture-frontend"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-layering-strategies","title":"模块化分层策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/modular-layering-strategies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"federation-and-composition","title":"联邦与组合","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/module-federation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"micro-frontend-runtime-integration","title":"微前端运行时集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/micro-frontend-runtime-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remote-component-loading","title":"远程组件加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/remote-component-loading"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"architecture-evolution","title":"架构演进策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"progressive-migration-patterns","title":"渐进式迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/progressive-migration-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-driven-architecture","title":"性能驱动架构决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/performance-driven-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-selection-framework","title":"技术选型决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/technology-selection-framework"}]}]}